  "description": "The doorbell rings at Snow White’s house, where she lives with the seven dwarfs. With “her” arrival, Snow White is overcome with anxiety… A breathless romantic suspense thriller set in the world of yuri, walking the line between love and obsession! A cruel fairy tale begins, one that will completely upend Snow White’s destiny.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated) \n\n*Note: Originally self-published on the author's Aladin account. Was published by Ridibooks on 2026-05-09.\n*",
